    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1654">

                <pb facs="1412" n="1308" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1308"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 816.001Ar1/6.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 18, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>At nine o’clock yesterday morning after trial and conviction by a military court
                    three of the assassins of President Araújo were publicly shot in the Campo de
                    Marte in the presence of many thousand spectators.</p>
                <p>The Government has informed me that perfect tranquility is reported to exist
                    throughout Salvador and that the signs portend a long period of peace.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Heimke</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
